      "general": {
        "abstract": "VCU's research station positioned on the north bank of the James River Estuary. This site houses many upland and wetland ecosystems. The marshes on the property were once damned (1920s) to create a recreational lake. In 2011 VCU removed the levy, and has been monitoring marsh restoration and recruitment. ",
